<title>GREECE: GREEK/BUND GAP STANDS AT 345BPS, VS OATS AT 358BPS.</title>
<headline>GREEK/BUND GAP STANDS AT 345BPS, VS OATS AT 358BPS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's 10-year, 8.80 percent</p>
<p>bond was trading 345 basis points over bunds, 358 basis points</p>
<p>over OATs and 232 basis points over BTPs at 1033 GMT on Tuesday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY    YIELDS    SPREADS</p>
<p>								   </p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07	9.17%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.0%    04JUL07	5.72%    345 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.5%    25APR07	5.59%    358 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07	6.85%    232 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07	6.42%    275 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07	6.40%    277 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07	7.18%    199 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07	6.62%    255 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
